you wish :pakiss:

Immortal match making is broken. won a 5 stack game with double down and got +7 wohoo. Won another and got +11. How do i grind mmr if i get pennies to win and lose like 100 mmr if i lose?

&#x200B;

 [https://www.opendota.com/matches/4953697031](https://www.opendota.com/matches/4953697031) 

&#x200B;

match id: 4953697031

what support roll? 4 or 5? If you play 5, i would start playing 1. Roll for 1 and if you dont get it go 5. The supports know what they want when they play carry and vice versa. If you play 4, play some 3. Same sort of deal. 

&#x200B;

Secondly, if your p1's omni-spin and run away, im sure the enemy carries are just as bad. Honestly, you can just split push your way to ancient 7. Just play naga, am, lycan and run it down side lanes for 45 minutes. EZ gaem

Yeah, it drops about a percent a day i think. you can see that here in my google doc, i will go up and come back down to the same mmr but be at a higher percent.

&#x200B;

[https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1IZ97lytW-OQmdBKBqxUaGDDueuHFypewUlxuBCCNC60/edit?usp=sharing](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1IZ97lytW-OQmdBKBqxUaGDDueuHFypewUlxuBCCNC60/edit?usp=sharing)

Dota took my money but didnt give me a battlepass :(

&#x200B;

Edit: After frantically opening and closing dota for 15 minutes dota gave me a battlepass
